# Domain and logic

Canonical types: `src/types/bingo.ts`. If docs/specs disagree, change types and code together — do not invent a third model.

- `BingoCell.position` is required (`0 .. size²-1`) and set when the cell is created. The engine depends on it.
- `BingoCard.size` is `2 | 3 | 4 | 5`. Cell count must equal `size * size`.
- Completion, title, and theme have a single representation. Honor `isFrozen` or remove it; do not leave dead flags.
- Editor: create via `addCard`, edit via `updateCard`. Play: one completion path (store action → `useBingoLogic` / engine). Never hardcode `isBingo = false`.
- Line vs full-card celebrations are separate. Revoke blob URLs. Backup import must validate a typed payload and must not dump all `localStorage` or rely on `location.reload()`.
- Do not add store actions that no UI can call. Validate non-empty title before save.
